#: ../../source/validation/report/index.rst:67
msgid "Keeping all of it current"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/validation/report/index.rst:69
msgid ""
"The badges in the README, the summary block above and the six pages are "
"all functions of what ``validation/`` claims, so a commit that changes a "
"granted file and leaves them alone publishes figures that are already "
"wrong. ``.githooks/pre-commit`` regenerates them and stages what it "
"rewrote, and never refuses a commit over it: a committer with no network "
"still has to be able to commit."
msgstr ""

